# Optional research collection (spec §6.5). Leave unset and the app has no
# route out of the browser: the contribute section never renders, no fetch is
# reachable, and the intro screen goes back to promising nothing is transmitted.
#
# Set it to the Cloudflare Worker in server/ to turn collection on. It is a
# public URL, not a secret — in CI it lives as a repository *variable* named
# COLLECT_ENDPOINT. Build-time rather than runtime, so unsetting it removes the
# feature from the artifact rather than merely hiding it.
#
# VITE_COLLECT_ENDPOINT=https://israquiz-collect.example.workers.dev
